cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "El Sheeto: I/O and models in type-annotated Python for NGS sample sheets"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Holtgrewe
    given-names: Manuel
    email: manuel.holtgrewe@medgen-mainz.de
    affiliation: "Limbach Genetics eGbR, Medizinische Genetik Mainz"
repository-code: "https://github.com/medgen-mainz/elsheeto"
url: "https://elsheeto.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"
abstract: >-
  El Sheeto parses, validates, modifies, and writes next-generation sequencing
  sample sheets in the Illumina v1 and Element Biosciences Aviti formats, using
  type-annotated Pydantic models.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - next-generation sequencing
  - sample sheet
  - Illumina
  - Aviti
